        "description": "Server-to-Server API for managing validation rules: create, list, retrieve, update, and delete.\n\n**Note:** This API is currently a draft and subject to change.\n\nLinks:\n  - [Create rule](https://dev.appsflyer.com/hc/reference/new-validation-rules-create-rule)\n  - [List rules](https://dev.appsflyer.com/hc/reference/new-validation-rules-list-rules)\n  - [Get rule](https://dev.appsflyer.com/hc/reference/new-validation-rules-get-rule)\n  - [Update full rule](https://dev.appsflyer.com/hc/reference/new-validation-rules-update-rule)\n  - [Delete rule](https://dev.appsflyer.com/hc/reference/new-validation-rules-delete-rule)\n  - [Update rule status](https://dev.appsflyer.com/hc/reference/new-validation-rules-update-rule-status)\n\n  Full update only. PATCH is not supported. Use If-Match for optimistic concurrency.\n",
        "operationId": "new-validation-rules-update-rule",
